{
  "title": "Yellowed Garlicky Mediterranean Salmon Kebabs",
  "description": "A low-calorie, garlicky Mediterranean dish featuring salmon, perfect for a lazy Sunday, cooked to perfection in a tandoor",
  "cuisine": "Mediterranean",
  "diet": [
    "low-calorie",
